{"server":"cn","storyId":"act23side_level_act23side_st01","groupId":"act23side","stageId":"act23side_st01","title":"忽梦少年事","storyCode":"WB-ST-1","avgTag":"幕间","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act23side/level_act23side_st01.txt","sourceHash":"dbf53e064773a04c9e7ef6421678838b1df888fb7fe02750618ac2aca0d6568b","bodyAvailable":true,"summaryText":"梁洵、魏彦吾、太傅、令等人齐聚玉门，为重岳即将离任做准备。老鲤和槐琥也来到这里寻找槐天裴的下落。就在此时，林雨霞在城外发现了遇害的天灾信使队伍。","blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g04_yaninn"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g04_yaninn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙门游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"老板，你这电视剧咋播的？怎么直接从十七集跳到二十集了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"碟片被沙子刮花了，有几集就是播不了，将就看吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙门游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"正看到关键地方呢，戚清秋和沈飞白上一集还打得你死我活，这会儿咋个又并肩作战了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"饮酒的老客","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"中间这三集啊，讲的是戚清秋确认了沈飞白就是自己的杀师仇人，要去找他拼命。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"饮酒的老客","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但是到了玉门才发现，沈飞白已经投身军伍，还担任了不低的军职。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"饮酒的老客","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当下正是强敌犯境，戚清秋夜不能寐，想通了国仇大过家恨的道理，便也投入宗师麾下一同抗敌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"饮酒的老客","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剧情很简单，但十九集那场悬崖论剑，可真是经典啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙门游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"我天，您是看了多少遍，记得这么清楚？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"在这玉门城里，你路边随便逮一个小孩，都能把《玉门风云》的剧情倒背如流。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"不过这位客人刚刚漏说了一段。戚清秋在军中见到沈飞白，并没有马上放下仇恨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"当时是那位宗师站了出来，说先由自己代沈飞白接下戚清秋报仇的一剑。这才有了那场悬崖论剑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"当时乌云密布，飞沙走石，好像天地万物都要为这场比武作见证。说时迟那时快，两人拔出剑来——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨尔贡打扮的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_792_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不太熟练的炎国语）胡说，胡说！简直是胡说八道！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨尔贡打扮的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_792_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这部电视剧，打戏好看，但细节一点都不严谨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"何昔安，你又来了。炎国话都没学利索，你看得懂拍的是什么吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨尔贡打扮的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_792_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当然，知道！《玉门风云》讲的是五十年前发生的真事。有许多，江湖侠客消除恩怨，在那位宗师的带领下抗击外敌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨尔贡打扮的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_792_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我还知道，里面好多场面就是在这只客栈拍的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"“间”，“这间”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨尔贡打扮的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_792_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙门游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"这外国兄弟，对大炎历史了解得还挺清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨尔贡打扮的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_792_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我当然清楚。那位宗师教我武功的时候亲自告诉我的，在萨尔贡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨尔贡打扮的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_792_1","isRemote":false,"text":"宗师是有一把剑。但那把剑很特殊，是绝对不能出鞘的！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"又是这套。你要真是宗师的亲传弟子，怎么昨天在擂台上三两下就输给了那个菲林小姑娘？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"萨尔贡打扮的游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_792_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲林小姑娘怎么了，她武艺十分的厉害，你凭什么瞧不起人家？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙门游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"萨尔贡老兄，炎国话里这种说法，不是瞧不起小姑娘，是瞧不起......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"起哄的众人","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈哈哈哈......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙门游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"话说回来，如果电视剧是真实事件改编，玉门还真有这样一段江湖武人与军队联手抗敌的历史吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"龙门游客","speakerId":"avg_npc_033","isRemote":false,"text":"“侠之大者，为国为民”，既身在江湖逍遥自在，又能保家卫国一展抱负，不愧是玉门，想一想真是酷。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"饮酒的老客","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"电视里演的终归是故事，多少美化过了。历史到底怎么样，不去问经历过的人，又怎么能说得清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"饮酒的老客","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"再说了，现在早就不是在战场上撸袖子拼刀枪的时代了。真想报效国家啊，还是学好源石技艺，去当个天师靠谱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"饮酒的老客","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"玉门这样的边防要塞，要没有这么多普通人生活在这里维持城市运作，光靠其他城市补给，得耗费多少倍的资源？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"饮酒的老客","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当年兴建城市，愿意拖家带口搬迁到这偏远苦寒地方的人，还有至今愿意留在这里的人，哪一个担不起一句“为国为民”？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"饮酒的老客","speakerId":"avg_npc_797_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说起来，电视剧里唯一可以确定是真人真事的那位宗师，现在也要走咯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"让一让。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"送药。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"辛苦，放边上就行，一会我再让伙计搬到后堂去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"医生调好的跌打药、烫伤药都在这。这个月补给不足，没有多的药材可以给你们做药膳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"药钱收好，每次都麻烦医生，真是不好意思。这是客栈前些日子进的物资，你带些回医馆吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"哎，东西有点多，稍等会，我叫个伙计帮你一起搬过去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"魁梧的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_785_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不用。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"满满一车东西，就这么扛走了?"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"医馆到底是上哪找的伙计，力气还真不小......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"哟，先生下来了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在客栈住了几天，您这一楼大堂就没有空着的时候。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"这不前些日子玉门与龙门对接补给，可谁知道偏偏在这时候遇上天灾，两座城市只能紧急拆分。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"事出突然，不少商人、游客都还滞留在玉门，这段时间城里的客栈都是满客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"招待的人多，要操心的事也多。大家又多是性情中人，只怕稍有不慎，就要闹出乱子，唉......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"生意太好，这是多少同行羡慕不来的麻烦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过也是，如果我龙门的那点小买卖也像您这一样红火，估计也头疼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"今天先给先生上一壶茶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好。劳老板打听的消息......？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"喏，您看，这是半年来玉门擂台榜的排名变动情况，您找的那位“武林高手”要是不在上面，那我也没辙了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没想到，玉门如今还保留着擂台比武这样的传统......的确是，武德丰沛。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"平祟侯治军严格，现在也不需要大伙儿帮忙上阵杀敌了，就留这样一块擂台，供武人没事的时候活动筋骨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"总之，您要是不急，不如在店里多待几天。来来往往客人这么多，没准就有谁碰巧见过您要找的人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，先生可以去城南铸剑坊打听打听。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"那里的师傅是老江湖了，城里走南闯北、有些资历的武人和镖客都常在那儿聚会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢......人生地不熟，办事到底是不方便。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"多嘴问一句，还没听先生讲过，您辛苦找人，是寻恩还是寻仇？还是要讨一笔债？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算起来，那人还真是欠了我好大一笔债......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_lungmen_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这一次，又要走多久？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不知道。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还回来吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"事做成了就回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你还记不记得，三天后就是槐琥的生日。要是弟妹泉下有知，又会怎么说你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我当不好丈夫，也当不好父亲。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐天裴","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我这辈子，能成一件事就够了。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"25_g04_yaninn"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"讨债？那恐怕是难喽。大炎土地何其辽阔，单说这玉门城，就不下十万人口。一个人存心想躲起来，该从何找起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"莫急莫急，您的茶好了，不如先喝杯茶，再配一碟玉门特色的酱兽肉？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，那我就先坐一会，等我家姑娘在外面打完那场比赛吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"来，前阵子刚进来的龙门春茶，这么新鲜的茶叶，我们也是好几年才能喝上一回。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"多谢，如此珍贵的东西，让我喝了，总觉得有点浪费啊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"哪儿的话。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这味道......龙门这个时节的春茶，按理不该有这种涩味啊......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......是你？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们没有说过要在这见面。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"呃......这位姑娘？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......你不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"二位认识吗？正好小店都坐满了，要不二位拼个桌？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不认识。我一杯茶的工夫就走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不碍事，不碍事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"掌柜","speakerId":"avg_npc_140","isRemote":false,"text":"好嘞，二位随意。有需要再吩咐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘是把我错认成什么人了吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"眼熟而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"想来是许久未见的老朋友......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"算是......喝你的茶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也请姑娘喝一杯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不认识我，却要请我喝茶？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"错认也算相逢，相逢即是有缘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"也祝姑娘早点找到那位老朋友。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早点也无趣，等时间到了，自然就找到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这话倒是有意思。越是许久未见的人，答案往往不在那个人身上，而在找他的时间里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你对谁都这么啰嗦吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不敢......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"姑娘这就走？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"冷漠的女性","speakerId":"avg_npc_786_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说了只坐一杯茶的工夫。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"老鲤","speakerId":"avg_322_lmlee_1","isRemote":false,"text":"真是怪事......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g6_yumengate"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公子难得回来一趟，不先去见见将军吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"军中事务繁多，父亲大概正在忙碌，我还是先不去打扰......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下无意多言。只是尚蜀一事，肃政院已有定论，公子所为堂堂正正，不必觉得有愧于将军。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"回家也没什么事情可做，不如先看看城中的情况。太傅这次派我回玉门，恐怕是预见到了一些变故，我应该提前留意。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公子若是为了公务，在下自当奉陪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太合叔也多年没回玉门了，想必也有不少感慨。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚一路走来，城中民生景象，确实比我离开时，多了不少变化。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"北境战事连年不断，玉门依然能护百姓乐业安居，将军治军理政之能，在下叹服。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城边这擂台，还是一样热闹。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我刚才看到，太合叔的名字还高挂在擂台榜的第五位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过是另一种虚名罢了。若早日有青年才俊将在下从那张榜上踢下来，才是令人高兴的事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在台上的那两位姑娘......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太合叔在看什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下只是在琢磨，以公子的武功，比擂台上的那两位姑娘如何。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"咳......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太傅说过，秉烛人的职责，在明烛以驱巨兽之影，巡游以察社稷之患。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"最重要的是铭记职责，行事机敏，武功倒是次要......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"公子所言甚是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左乐","speakerId":"avg_npc_297_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......那依太合叔看，我的武功，和擂台上那两位姑娘相比？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"太合","speakerId":"avg_npc_299_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恕在下直言，公子虽然轻功卓绝，但若与之正面交手，胜负当在三七之间......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g6_yumengate"},{"type":"narration","text":"擂台上的两人已经交手十个回合。\n喘息未定，抢攻。\n菲林女孩欺身而上，拳风绵密，叠出一连串的爆音，牢牢压制住对方拿着武器的手。\n再一合，二人对上一脚，她的对手，一个异族打扮的少女借力荡开。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"停！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你已经出擂台了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"擂台地方狭窄，你用的是远程武器，发挥空间有限，不占优势......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但规则就是规则，你输了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"异族装扮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的武功很好，可招式路数我好像从来没有见过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"异族装扮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（不太熟练的炎国语）输了这一场，是不是就，不能继续比赛了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"虽说习武之人不该把胜负看得太重，但现在，我也有非赢不可的理由......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"异族装扮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也是，想要拿剑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"剑？什么剑？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"异族装扮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"城里的人说，擂台榜上排名第一的人，可以得到一把，特殊的剑。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不......我只是想要取得更高的成绩，为了有人能看到我的名字。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"异族装扮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，排名三十一。就是说，在你前面，还有三十个人比你更厉害？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......按理说是这样的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"异族装扮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你的武功，的确比我厉害。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"异族装扮的少女","speakerId":"avg_4078_bdhkgt_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（看来这个方法......）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"欸，怎么说走就走......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"赢下了这一场，名字就可以出现在擂台榜的第一页了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"槐琥","speakerId":"avg_243_waaifu_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是，他会看到吗......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g8_yumenarena"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"十五合，千夫长着剑四处。右腕，左肋，中腹，咽喉。仇白无伤。仇白胜。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫长","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，输了输了。这要是战场，我已经在仇姑娘的剑下死了三回了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"擂台切磋比的是武技，战场杀敌比的是心性。真要在生死场上，没命的恐怕是我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"千夫长","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"仇姑娘一直在宗师身边，武功与见识果然都是一日千里。我甘拜下风。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......承让。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"让我看看宗师对录武簿的批注。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"近日记录都在这里。老师事务繁忙，但还是格外关注师姐的对战，对你的剑术也多是赞誉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"师姐还有心事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在想，他说的“剑意不纯”是什么意思。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有，凭这样的剑术，要到什么时候才能打败他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师口述的《武典》里并没有相关论述，这句话应该也只是对师姐说过。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于“打败宗师”，这世上有这样念头的人，恐怕也不多。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你也笑我不自量力？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是做分内工作，跟在老师身边，如实记录品评世上武功而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......今天校场貌似多了不少人，为什么偏偏他不在？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是左将军有些客人来访。老师好像也要在城楼上见一位故人。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"既然这样，我先走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"师姐慢走。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你跟随宗师的时间远比我长，为什么还要这样称呼我？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"老师说，执笔录事者，更需要发现他人长处的眼光。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"录武官","speakerId":"avg_npc_791_1","isRemote":false,"text":"论武功和阅历，师姐都在我之上，我有不少地方需要学习。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"仇白","speakerId":"avg_npc_787_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......算了，随你吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g8_yumenarena"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"面目威严的男人","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"常服的将军搭箭扣弦，杯口粗的雕弓被拉得形如满月。\n他持弓的手微微颤抖，箭矢也随之晃动。每晃动一次，将军的眉头就多蹙起一分。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"铁制的箭矢一半箭身没入草垛，离靶心稍稍偏了些。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将军好弓术。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"何必虚言。我的身体，我自己心里有数。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两年前还能舞剑提枪，空挥几个来回，今年却连弓都握不稳了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"就算现在不用亲自上战场，可是让一个病人担任玉门守将，总归是不合适......我的时间也不多了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将军这一身伤，是守护玉门几十载的见证。这份功绩，朝堂上下，无人敢忘。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左某这副身子倒不可惜，只是眼下还有几件大事尚未完成......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下这次来到玉门，也是领太傅之命，协助将军。玉门归国的上下事务，在下一并担责。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太傅他老人家，说的是“协助”吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将军应该明白，太傅的意思......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"托梁大人在尚蜀帮我办了事，我好像还没有道过谢。左乐那孩子年轻，行事不周，给梁大人添麻烦了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将军言重了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当父母的心思，只怕梁大人还是难以明白。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子的成就看在眼里，但更怕他犯一星半点的错。左乐现在背负的职责，也容不得他出错。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"左公子年少有为，心思机敏。年轻人偶尔行事冒进，也是正常的事。将军不必过于担心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那在梁大人看来，左某的所作所为，算不算冒进？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我相信左将军，肯定有自己的考量。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人身为尚蜀父母官，勤政爱民，我在玉门也有耳闻。只是不知梁大人，有没有接触过战场兵戈？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"几年前尚蜀江上闹过水匪......这些自然不能和将军经历的战场相提并论。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那梁大人也该明白，为将者临阵定夺，和为官者为民理政，终究不是一回事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"战场军情瞬息万变，万千将士生死系在你一念之间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人觉得，这种时候需要的是决断的勇气，还是权衡利弊的心机？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"岁兽一事，箭已在弦上，不得不发。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下受教。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如今梁大人来到玉门，担任这“玉门参知”，也算身处沙场，你我二人更是同僚。左某的做派，希望梁大人理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下自当尽心竭力，也愿意相信将军。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可如今大炎面对的巨兽问题，既不是为民理政，也不是战场杀伐。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在下相信将军的决断，也请将军相信在下的权衡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"又是一箭射出，这次箭矢正中靶心。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梁大人，你也试试？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"久闻梁知府可不只是文才惊艳，剑术弓术也均有涉猎，是文武双全的才俊。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"只是我这玉门的弓沉，不知梁大人拉得开否？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"将军，龙门魏总督已经到了，在军中议事厅等您。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好，我知道了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"林先生的女儿先到了几天，算算日子，魏公也该到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"巡防营守军","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"另外，太傅也已经到了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太傅和魏公，是一起来的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"梁洵","speakerId":"avg_npc_295_1","isRemote":false,"text":"魏公此行，想来并非为了公事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是公是私，到底是要用一张桌子同时招待这两位贵客。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"左宣辽","speakerId":"avg_npc_788_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来今天，要提点左某的，不止梁大人一位啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_i01"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大哥。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我昨夜忽然做了一个梦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"梦见午夜窗外风吹得急，打开窗户，城外沙漠竟然变成了一片树海。株株胡杨长出新芽，有的竟然开出了花。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"树的枝桠生得很长，结成了一张网。整座玉门城被紧紧缠住，再行动不得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"人不辞路，花难留枝。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"大哥对玉门还是有些不舍？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我都有些忘了，你上次离开玉门的时候，留下的是哪一句？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"清夜满城丝管散，行人不信是边头。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"似乎是新句子。有些时日不见，看来令妹的心境又有了变化。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g3_yumenobservationtower_d"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"百年，算不上太长。只是梦到了这里，便又回来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可在我眼中，这“百年”也是三万多个日夜。是每一次军情急报，每一次斥候出关，每一次信使归来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在你走后，守城的将士不知更替过几轮，这城墙上的砖石也不知修缮过多少次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所幸它还能伫立在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在尚蜀，你见过年和夕了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"见是见过了。两人都和过去一样，一点没变，如今还找到了一个可以容身玩闹的好去处。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那想来，你也见过二弟了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们这些弟弟妹妹，是没有一个不让大哥操心的了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"夕妹心思细，想得多，又偏偏不愿意找人倾诉，总将自己圈在那一方小天地里，难免憋出问题来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"年看上去自在洒脱，却是最怕寂寞的那个。若没什么新鲜事能让她分一分神，她就要和自己过不去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你，我当然不操心。唯一在意的，就是怕你醉得太尽兴，忘了付酒钱，让店家为难。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过作为长姐，又没有公务在身，你对弟弟妹妹也该多关照一点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兄长这是在责怪我不会当姐姐？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这世上又有几家人是我们这样的关系，我又该向谁去学......终归只能靠自己参悟的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奈何这几个不太开窍的妹妹，偏偏参不透事里事外，要自寻烦恼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不怪她们参不透，若换你在她们的视角上，你也未必还能如此洒脱。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"要说洒脱，我到底也没法像兄长这样，将“我”完全割舍出来，再找到一个新的“我”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“朔”这个名字，还有那缕残魂，都一并封印在了那把剑里。现在的我，不过是一个稍擅拳脚的凡夫俗子罢了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好一个“稍擅拳脚”，你这简简单单一句话，绝了多少武子修炼的道路？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一日的锻炼换来一日的功夫。以数百年的时间跨度来看，我这句“稍擅拳脚”，恐怕都有自大之嫌了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"斜前方的沙渠，一刻不停地吞吐着数以吨计的黄沙，为玉门的前行排解阻力。\n庞大的移动城市，正以高速奔向它新的终点。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"令","speakerId":"avg_2023_ling_1","isRemote":false,"text":"兄长接下来离开玉门的话，又作何打算？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"离开北边，就南下去看看小桥流水，再去尝一口中原的烧酒，或是去年和夕逗留的地方看看。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"偌大江湖，总有地方可去。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"重岳","speakerId":"avg_2024_chyue_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......只是过去一同举杯言笑的人，如今一个都寻不到了吧。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"远眺，沙海热浪蒸腾，天地因迷离而粗粝。\n长风吹彻，到城楼时劲头已弱，扬起的细沙粒扑在两颊，触感竟称得上柔和。\n黄沙远来三千地，洗罢流年一屈指。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"35_g11_yumendesert"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门守军A","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......从装备识别码来看，的确是本该在今天上午回城的天灾信使队伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门守军A","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现场有烈性源石炸药残留的痕迹，尸体恐怕已经，结晶粉尘化了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......小心源石残留。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里离城市只有不到两小时的路程，究竟是谁会在这么近的地方袭击官方天灾信使？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门守军A","speakerId":"avg_npc_795_1","isRemote":false,"text":"随行物资里值钱的货物都已经被带走，从这一点看，像是流寇所为。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......还是有人刻意想让这看上去是流寇所为？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"继续搜，要是找不到天灾观测数据，就真的麻烦了......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门守军B","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"找到了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门守军B","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"稍远一点的地方，在一片破碎的铠甲下面找到的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玉门守军B","speakerId":"avg_npc_796_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是兄弟们拼死保下来的......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"林雨霞","speakerId":"avg_4080_lin_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没时间了，警惕周围动向，立刻将数据送回城。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"}],"observedOperators":[]}
